 r←Test_AskNumber_004(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise the "Create" method with some props.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.caption←0⊃⎕XSI
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 myGuiParms.TestMode←0

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.question←'Number of copies:'
 parms.value←¯2
 parms.maxLength←60
 parms.timeout←0.1

 n←myGuiParms parms(#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber ∆Ask)''
 ⎕DL 0.2
 →GoToTidyUp 0=n.Progressbar.Visible
 ⎕NQ n.Input'GotFocus'
 ⎕NQ n.Btn1'GotFocus'
 2 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp 1=n.Progressbar.Visible
 ⎕NQ n.Btn1'Select'
 →GoToTidyUp~0∊⍴n.∆result
 →GoToTidyUp 0≠n.∆OK
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
